<title>TURKEY: Turkish Bank Kapital signs 22.5 mln mark loan.</title>
<headline>Turkish Bank Kapital signs 22.5 mln mark loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's private Bank Kapital will sign a 22.5 million mark syndicated loan accord on Tuesday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the one-year pre-export financing loan was provided by an 11-bank consortium, led by Berliner Bank.</p>
